  "body": "Direct-PR: daily docs-only fold of the pending fragment (`tooling/docs/fold.py` through `hygiene.py --apply`), a fold PR that needs no adversarial review and merges on green CI (AGENTS.md §8).\n\nThe problem: one fragment (`docs/changelog-legacy.d/651.md`) was pending.\n\nWhat changed: the fragment folded into `docs/CHANGELOG-LEGACY.md`, the fragment file removed. Nothing else (the README table counts are unchanged).\n\nTests: `python3 tooling/docs/fold.py --check` passes (\"docs fold check: ok\"); the script reproduces the PR on its base.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CEBkjmFApUaMrewUvD)_\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Accessibility**\n  * Read conversation titles in private-message lists retain their secondary color and appear darker in light theme, increasing contrast from 3.4:1 to 6:1.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
